# POSIX regex patterns for secrets detection — used by pre-push hook
# Each pattern separated by |
PATTERNS='\
ghp_[0-9A-Za-z]{36,}\
|gho_[0-9A-Za-z]{36,}\
|ghu_[0-9A-Za-z]{36,}\
|ghs_[0-9A-Za-z]{36,}\
|ghr_[0-9A-Za-z]{36,}\
|sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}\
|AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}\
|Bearer\s+[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]{20,}\
|xox[bpsar]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{10,}\
|-----BEGIN (RSA |EC )?PRIVATE KEY-----'
